    <author>Domestique Library</author>
    <name>Neuromuscular 5x30s (74min)</name>
    <description>Warmup: 10min ramp from 50% to 75% FTP | Intervals: 5 x (30s @ 180% / 0s @ 55%) | Cooldown: 8min 15s from 65% to 40% FTP</description>
